+      "setup": "Eight seeded random terrains (seeds 401 to 408), 2.4 km, 30 m cells, fast tier, embers off (an ember jumping the break is a different random draw, so it is not comparable), model's own moisture and heating, seeded wind 15 to 40 km/h, point ignition 300 to 500 m upwind of a two-cell-wide strip of non-burnable ground across the whole domain, perpendicular to the wind, 1 h.",
+      "mark": "The burnt area with the strip is not larger than without it at any 600 s mark, to within one cell (0.09 ha).",
+      "slackHa": 0.09
