From a51000daddc482c1633b763c3f5031563cc15264 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 08:08:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] 0.10.0 validity: cross-engine check, the golden scenarios
 in Node and in a Chromium worker

The scenarios are built and run in Node, handed as bytes to the production build's own SimClient (a Web Worker in Chromium) and fingerprinted at every golden mark with the very same code; the e2e fails if any hash differs and says which parts and by how much.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016zPE7K49ycKieo7wJdrBFN
---
